      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_Park%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Bush Presidential Center, the presidential library for George W. Bush, sits on the Southern Methodist University campus near University Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
